00:43:57,271 --> 00:43:58,706
You're like this.

1023
00:43:58,806 --> 00:44:00,609
And then
none of this shit matters.

1024
00:44:00,708 --> 00:44:02,209
-Yeah, doesn't matter.
-Yeah, great. Okay.

